tore_item_assets/steam/apps/3453490/extras/bd4cab1ca24113c82bcef71fd2949618.webm?t=1753442111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453490/extras/bd4cab1ca24113c82bcef71fd2949618.mp4?t=1753442111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEWARE THE RAIN</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When traveling through the night unprotected, the rain will come \u2013 said to be the source of the mysterious blight plaguing your home. Only the light of torches and campfires can shield you from its touch. Continuing through the rain is unwise and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453490/extras/9c422f6f6106d384778e9a96d103e017.poster.avif?t=1753442111\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453490/extras/9c422f6f6106d384778e9a96d103e017.webm?t=1753442111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453490/extras/9c422f6f6106d384778e9a96d103e017.mp4?t=1753442111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE VOID</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your travels, you\u2019ll encounter dangerous enemies and mysterious characters who have found ways to endure the vile rain. Yet, many of the friendlier ones would surely accept the help of a resourceful traveler like you. Speak with them and decide for yourself if their cause is worth your time and support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
